# g95-fu-ssh-service: a server's toasts are closed when its notifier ends (host/notification/close), the presence answer keeps a host whose relay
# could not be asked apart from an offline one, and windowFocus names every session a window shows.
# New protocol type: src/v2/host_notification.rs (created by this task): HostNotificationCloseParams { connectionId }. Its module line is in the .wire.

