[notifications]
After HostNotificationShow (src/notifications.rs, the "// ---- connection-scoped" group), before HostBrowserViewFrames:

    /// The core closes the toasts still showing for a server's connection (its notifier ended).
    HostNotificationClose => "host/notification/close" (HostNotificationCloseParams) @connection,

and `use crate::v2::host_notification::HostNotificationCloseParams;` beside the HostNotificationShowParams import.

