# none

[free_text]
# none (the params hold an opaque connection id)

[type_edits]
# src/v2/connections.rs
1. RemoteHostPresenceResult: add the field after `online`:

       /// Hosts the relay reported offline. A host in neither list could not be asked (its relay did not answer): its state is unknown.
       #[serde(default)]
       pub offline: Vec<String>,

   (the service builds it in mixdog-connections service.rs "remoteHosts/presence"; service_tests asserts {"online": [...], "offline": [...]}).
2. WindowFocusEntry: replace
       pub session_id: Option<String>,   (with its doc and serde attributes)
   by
       /// Every session the window shows on screen (one per pane of a split view); empty when it shows none.
       #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = "Vec::is_empty")]
       pub session_ids: Vec<String>,
   and in the same file's test `a_window_request_and_the_focus_value_keep_their_wire_names` use `"sessionIds": ["t"]` in the WindowFocusValue round trip.
   Regenerate packages/protocol (WindowFocusEntry.sessionIds, RemoteHostPresenceResult.offline, HostNotificationCloseParams, the notification row).

